  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.24 - fix: drawing several pictures in a row with FLUX 3 no longer loses the WebGPU device (the VAE decoder's 3.2 GB of feature maps are freed after each picture; Flux2Pipeline.ReleaseDecoderMemory), Flux3Pipeline.CreateAsync(vaeTileLatent), a [VRAM] stage trace in the 3D page. Since v5.3.12: FLUX 3 Image Klein and the Qwen3 caption writer, FLUX.2 klein, SkinTokens rigging and Kimodo animation, the TRELLIS.2 export tail on the GPU. Full history: CHANGELOG.md.",
